> > variable "on-the-fly", uses it and discards it right after the analysis?
> > And
> > there is no way to tell the program to keep it somehow?
> > If so, is there a way to create it manually using data in ddf data object
> > (ddf.79 in my case)? Can it be done using dht() command in MRDS library?
